OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry arrest after death
OL,4,Aof woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of woman in
OL,8,Fher 70s.
OL,10,FHampshire Police said it was called to
OL,11,Fa "concern for welfare" at a property
OL,12,Fon Cyprus Road in Portsmouth just
OL,13,Fbefore 10:00 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FThe force said a woman in her 70s was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene and that
OL,17,Fher death was currently being treated
OL,18,Fas suspicious.
